@fula122You can always point out the people who are stuck on the SEC bias and can’t go beyond that to actually have a good conversation about CFB. This man said every conference is the same and the SEC is included……

No it’s not. Try telling a Texas fan in 2015 that the Big 12 that had high powered offenses and average/below average defenses was the same as the SEC or Big 10 at that point. 

Every conference has its positives and negatives that differentiate from the others. This year, it’s clear the ACC, Big 12, and SEC have better QB play than the Big 10 but you can possibly point out that the Big 10 has better defenses than the rest of CFB.

